/-
ToeFormal/Derivation/QFTGRMinimalPositiveConservationWitnessPacketUnderStrictToyAssumptions

Lean-side marker for the QFT-GR minimal positive conservation witness packet
under strict toy assumptions. The packet consumes the accepted obstruction-class
stabilization packet result review, carries weak_pairing_domain_obstruction as
an unresolved dominant obstruction candidate, defines a deliberately small toy
bridge with allowed weak tests, weak pairing, source object, divergence pairing,
field-equation residual, divergence identity, compact support/no-boundary
condition, and future pass/fail/inconclusive criteria. It selects only the
packet result-review target. It does not execute a witness attempt, construct a
conservation proof object or witness, claim source admissibility, claim Bianchi
compatibility, derive the semiclassical Einstein equation, close QFT-GR,
validate empirically, authorize public submission, or promote the master action.
-/

